## 检索策略

**主要检索词（PubMed / PMC）**：
- "executive control prefrontal cortex three components"
- "goal maintenance working memory DLPFC subspace"
- "proactive interference suppression white matter IFOF"
- "rule switching prefrontal cortex SST interneurons"
- "lateral PFC hierarchy rostral caudal gradient"
- "neural manifold working memory PFC"
- "mPFC striatum working memory maintenance optogenetics"
- "subspace orthogonalization task switching"

**筛选标准**：
1. 需要有开放全文（PMC/PubMed Central）或摘要具备足够的方法+结果细节
2. 优先因果实验（光遗传、损伤、TMS）而非纯相关研究
3. 需有具体效应量或统计数据（不接受定性描述）
4. 物种多样性：优先有人类数据，同时包含啮齿类因果实验

